        },
        {
          "text": " mam kereka ibusakinit yes ajenun ebe abu EJAKAIT, Edeke loka Isirael koinak Daudi ajakanut naka Isirael ikar kere, ŋes, ka odweke kaitutuket naka abalaŋ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
