            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.29.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Any 29:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mam baca yes ipotu kireŋeasi isasedotin luka EJAKAIT, odwe luka Aaron, ka Ilebin, kodumut isasedotin kopone loka ituŋa lukacekwapin? Tape loebuni atiakun bon kemoŋ lotobait ka imerekekin ikanykaarei, epedori araun esasedoti loka ŋul lumam eraas idekesio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye do isio, EJAKAIT ŋes Edekekosi, mam sio kipou kajalata ŋes; kija isio ka isasedotin luijaanakinete EJAKAIT, odwe luka Aaron, ka Ilebin toma aswamukec: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
