              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " icweikinete kesi ŋinitupuruc ka ŋinitibon ainakineta nuieweio, ka lukisupurununo lueuru maa: inapanakinete kesi imugatin luka aitodikin omesa loesegaara; ka epir loka atalai loka esabu ka atalaike ainok ŋinitiboŋ: naarai kiric isio akiro nuka EJAKAIT Ewokodeke; konye ipotu yesi kojalata ŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
