        {
          "text": " Ido koany, ejai Edeke kasio kiŋarenikinit, ka isasedotinike karupepen nuka elulu akusia elulu asurokin yes. Yes idwe luka Isirael, sirikisurokis EJAKAIT, Edeke loka lukapapaakus; naarai mam ikeriakaros.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
