          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwaŋin kitonokokai idwe luka Isirael kapaarasia kaŋun, kipikosi idwe luka Yuda naarai kegoŋakina EJAKAIT, Edeke loka lukapapaakec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
